  "description": "Jakar.Json as ASP.NET Core's JSON serializer for [JsonModel] types: MVC input/output formatters (AddJakarJson), and for minimal APIs typed results, a request-body wrapper and an endpoint filter. Other types keep using System.Text.Json. Reflection-free.",
