  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "10.3.0: TempData reads a stored model back as the type the app loaded, even when the model's assembly is loaded twice (an isolating test runner, a plugin host); built against Jakar.Json 10.3.0. 10.2.1: built against Jakar.Json 10.2.0, whose writers take a ref TWriter; 10.2.0 calls the removed IBufferWriter overloads and throws MissingMethodException with Jakar.Json 10.2.0. 10.2.0: TempData can hold [JsonModel] values (AddJakarJsonTempData). 10.1.0: initial release.",
